 Machine Learning Data Preprocessing Pipeline

A foundational Data Science project demonstrating an end-to-end data preprocessing pipeline in Python using Scikit-Learn, Pandas, and NumPy.

 Features
Data Ingestion: Fetches open-source datasets via fetch_openml.
Missing Value Imputation: Handled missing data using SimpleImputer.
Feature Encoding: Transformed categorical variables using OneHotEncoder and OrdinalEncoder.
Feature Scaling: Standardized numerical features using StandardScaler for machine learning algorithms.
Data Splitting: Applied train_test_split to structure datasets for model training and evaluation.

 Built With
* Python 3
* Scikit-Learn, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib
